{"3749070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Typeria", "steam_appid": 3749070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749070/extras/d102a90de743c93b9e78bcc9694673d9.poster.avif?t=1768360590\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749070/extras/d102a90de743c93b9e78bcc9694673d9.webm?t=1768360590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749070/extras/d102a90de743c93b9e78bcc9694673d9.mp4?t=1768360590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type to Shoot, and Scroll into Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keystroke fuels a dazzling in-game attack. Take down a vibrant cast of foes, push your adventure forward, and bring a new pulse of life to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Desktop Idle Companion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typeria is the perfect game for multitasking. It runs seamlessly alongside your work, studies, or web browsing, providing a continuous stream of gameplay and aesthetic delight right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command Followers, Collect Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and upgrade loyal followers to fight automatically on your behalf. Discover a wild collection of lost and peculiar weapons, each with unique firing styles—from arcing lightning and blooming flowers to raining blades—to style out your desktop like never before.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749070/extras/d102a90de743c93b9e78bcc9694673d9.poster.avif?t=1768360590